{
  "case_id": "SS-STAR-1.20.1",
  "title": "飞星筹码冒烟：紫色/金色飞星的伤害、星光与「精英/Boss（含神化模组 NBT）」判定",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "shooting-star-chips"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：验证紫色飞星 / 金色飞星的**触发、伤害、星光与精英-神化判定**。金色飞星对「精英怪物或 Boss」额外造成**自身当前星光层数**的伤害 —— 本用例用`ssspawn` 的四种 elite 特征（plain / apoth 神化 Boss NBT / apothmini 神化精英 NBT / hp60 / armor25）分别验证产品判定 `EliteTargets.isEliteOrBoss` 与实际伤害是否一致。读数口径：`ssread` 里的 `t_hp` = 靶子当前血量，`ssfire` 的 `cd_started=1` = 共享冷却已写入。"
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "前置：生存模式 + 清背包；装钻石骰子（chip 槽由骰子星级决定，钻石 = 2+ 槽）；`ssclear` 清靶子并复位共享冷却。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/time set midnight",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doDaylightCycle false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssclear S1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe equipslot dice \"astral_dice:diamond_dice\" S1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "A 段：紫色飞星 × 普通僵尸。期望：精英判定 = 0，触发后靶子 -1、星光 +1。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe equipslot chip \"astral_dice:purple_shooting_star_chip\" S1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssspawn S1 plain",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssgeom S1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe eliteread S1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread S1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssfire S1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread S1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread S1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssclear S1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "B 段：换成金色飞星 × 普通僵尸（星光先置 0）。期望：精英判定 = 0，靶子只掉 2 点。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe equipslot chip \"astral_dice:purple_shooting_star_chip\" S1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
