    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "D 段：金色飞星 × **神化精英**（`apoth.miniboss=1b`，Apothic Elite）。星光置 5 ⇒ 期望伤害 2 + 5 = 7，靶子剩 13。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
